config DRM_APPLE_G4P
	tristate "Apple A8 GPU (G4P) power layer and core ID (bring-up)"
	depends on ARCH_APPLE || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF && PM
	help
	  Bring-up driver for the PowerVR Rogue based GPU of the Apple A8 (T7000, iPhone 6). It binds without
	  touching the hardware and powers the GPU up only on request through debugfs (module parameter
	  experimental=1). Not a graphics driver yet.
